The ablation in Table~\ref{tab:ablation} isolates each component. Removing the closure loss (V1) raises M1 significantly; the geometry conditioning (V4 vs.\ V5) provides an additional gain, confirming that per-pair FiLM modulation is essential for handling incidence-angle diversity.

